==Description==
The '''Speedy Elf''' was the second enemy that debuted in [[Krampus Frosthold]] as part of the [[Krampus' Revenge Event]]. It had slightly higher health than the enemy that spawned before it, the [[Basic Elf (Krampus Frosthold)|Basic Elf]], and was faster, which made it a slightly bigger threat. Additionally, on later waves, it spawned as a hidden enemy, which made it it even more threatening with adequate hidden detection.

==Appearance==
The '''Speedy Elf''' had pale skin. It had a light blue shirt with white fur along the sleeves, as well as stitch lines on the sides of the arms. It had a black belt, dark cyan pants and black shoes. It also wore a blue Christmas hat with a lightning bolt emblem on it.

==Strategy== 
*The '''Speedy Elf''' typically spawns in hordes. Area of effect towers like the [[Pyromancer]] or [[Mortar]] should be used to easily deal with this enemy.
*[[Hidden (Attribute)|Hidden]] '''Speedy Elves''' appear at Wave 6, which can slip past unprepared defenses. Towers with cheap hidden detection, like the [[Golden Pyromancer]], [[Accelerator]] or [[Minigunner]] can be effective against them.

